        </ul>
        <p>
            After sending the "STOP" message, you will receive one final confirmation message confirming your opt-out from that number. You will no longer receive SMS messages from that specific Focus Hive number unless you re-initiate contact or reply "START".
        </p>
        <p>
            Opting out of messages from one Focus Hive employee's number will not opt you out of messages from other Focus Hive employees if you are in communication with them separately via SMS from their distinct numbers.
